Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.21,0:20:44.97,DefaultTop,Fu,0,0,0,,Wow, 12,000 views.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.97,0:20:49.30,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Easy peasy, lemon squeezy for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.74,0:20:51.06,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Oh, they're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.33,0:20:52.32,Default,Mover,0,0,0,,Heya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.32,0:20:54.06,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Second floor, room in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.06,0:20:56.50,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Um, what's all this, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:58.76,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Huh? Didn't I mention it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.76,0:21:01.33,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Starting today, Masaki's moving in with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.33,0:21:02.19,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.19,0:21:03.46,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.46,0:21:05.20,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,But why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.62,0:21:08.29,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Now that we have momentum, \NI can't let this chance slip away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.29,0:21:10.20,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'll live with you, shoot tons of videos,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:13.88,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,and ride this wave to turn our channel \Ninto a powerhouse in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.88,0:21:14.96,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's the plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.96,0:21:16.38,Default,Live,0,0,0,,There you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.38,0:21:17.84,Default,Group,0,0,0,,M-Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.84,0:21:19.79,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Okay, you're helping, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.79,0:21:20.59,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.79,0:21:20.59,DefaultTop,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.61,0:21:23.66,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,That's one hell of a dream you got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.66,0:21:25.80,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Let me join your little group.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.80,0:21:27.47,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I assumed you already had.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.76,0:21:32.54,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,With that settled, let's talk \Nprofit share for our last video!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.54,0:21:34.85,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,A 50/50 share, like we agreed on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.79,0:21:37.21,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.21,0:21:39.56,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Where's my slice of the pie?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.56,0:21:42.25,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Um, that won't come into play for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.25,0:21:43.01,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.01,0:21:44.62,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Chance Akaishi told me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.62,0:21:46.74,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,MayoPan isn't even monetized yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.74,0:21:48.96,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,That's not what you promised!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.96,0:21:50.93,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I didn't promise you squat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.93,0:21:52.36,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I'm leaving all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.36,0:21:55.00,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Hand over my money!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:16.48,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(195,97)\fs16\fnComic Sans MS\an7\c&H141719&\pos(280.5,6.5)}Tokage\NSent you a sticker
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:16.48,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(195,97)\fs16\fnComic Sans MS\c&HFAC5F7&\3c&HC286C4&\bord1.5\blur1\pos(449,56)}Goodnight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.00,0:23:29.29,DefaultTop,Tokage,0,0,0,,Pay me, pay me, pay me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.78,0:23:27.80,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Masaki here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.80,0:23:29.29,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,MayoPan's got a new member!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.29,0:23:29.78,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.78,0:23:30.26,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You, duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.26,0:23:32.22,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,That's right! It's me, Tokage!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.22,0:23:33.98,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Honestly, I don't know if this will work out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.98,0:23:35.39,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Seriously? Try harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.39,0:23:37.93,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Next time: "The Star of the Next Video is Who?"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.89,0:23:37.64,Signs_EpTitle,Sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2E3234&}The Star of the Next Video is Who?
