Dialogue: 1,0:23:37.89,0:23:39.52,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b0\fs28\fnImpact\c&HE1CC56&\3c&HFDFDFD&\bord1\pos(181,5)}The Star
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.93,0:23:39.52,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,What? It's me?
